{"id":"2c8fb2a4f3910429","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-external-negation.md","title":"外部否定","display":"df-external-negation — 外部否定","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-external-negation","aliases":["91-df-external-negation","91-df-outer-negation"],"display":"df-external-negation — 外部否定","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-external-negation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-external-negation</span><span>91-df-outer-negation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-external-negation — 外部否定"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-external-negation-—-外部否定-$\\neg-T$\">df-external-negation — 外部否定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T\">\\(\\neg T\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> (含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的对象语言)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{out}}:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{out}}:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> 是下述定义的句法构造映射，真理谓词与编码固定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{out}\">\\(\\mathrm{out}\\)</span> 标明否定置于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 外部。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}external\\text{-}negation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{out}}(\\varphi)\n\\coloneqq\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\qquad(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}external\\text{-}negation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{out}}(\\varphi)\n\\coloneqq\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\qquad(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{out}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{out}}\\)</span> : 外部否定（external negation）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner)\">\\(\\neg T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner)\\)</span> : &quot;<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>不真&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>外部否定的含义：\n外部否定将否定符号放在真理谓词的&quot;外部&quot;，断言句子不真。</p>\n<p>“外部”是相对于真理谓词的句法位置而言。还必须区分两种语义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在 KF 的经典闭合模型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbb N,\\Gamma)\">\\((\\mathbb N,\\Gamma)\\)</span> 中，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\">\\(\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\)</span> 表示\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma\">\\(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma\\)</span>，所以间隙也满足该外部式。</li>\n<li>若直接在强 Kleene 部分语义中计算对象语言公式\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\">\\(\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\)</span>，当真理原子取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span> 时，\n其否定仍取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span>，并不变成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf t\">\\(\\mathbf t\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此不能把经典闭合模型的外部否认与强 Kleene 真值表混为一谈。\nKF 也不在“正公式”范围内假设一般的内外否定等价；二者等价需要\n关于该句确定性的额外条件。</p>\n<p>内外否定的哲学意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>外部否定：经典的&quot;不真&quot;概念</li>\n<li>内部否定：三值的&quot;否定是真的&quot;</li>\n<li>区分展示三值逻辑与经典逻辑的差异</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-external-negation-—-外部否定-$\\neg-T$","text":"df-external-negation — 外部否定 $\\neg T$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ (真理谓词, see [[91-df-truth-predicate]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\neg T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{out}}:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{out}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}external\\text{-}negation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{out}}(\\varphi)\n\\coloneqq\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\qquad(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{out}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathbb N,\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf t","display":false}],"bytes":1986,"backlinks":[{"id":"f28d9b3f22314622","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0f7fd19603cd4cce","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-external-negation]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-external-negation]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories.md]]\n[[91-df-implication-